{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://cent-ans.game/schemas/art_dn_catalog.schema.json",
  "title": "DN generation catalog (array of asset requests)",
  "description": "Fichiers : art/dn_catalog_architecture.json, art/dn_catalog_battle.json, art/dn_catalog_battle_extra.json, art/dn_catalog_campaign.json, art/dn_catalog_economy.json, art/dn_catalog_fields.json, art/dn_catalog_illus.json, art/dn_catalog_map_extra.json, art/dn_catalog_mobile.json, art/dn_catalog_nature.json, art/dn_catalog_nature_extra.json, art/dn_catalog_yaya.json. Schéma initial dérivé des données existantes (ADR 0829) : types, clés requises et clés inconnues refusées ; à resserrer (bornes, énumérations) quand le champ est touché.",
  "type": "array",
  "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "id": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "kind": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "seeds": {
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "backend3d": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "ingest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "yaw_fix": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "target_width_m": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "class": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target_height_m": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "target_length_m": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "out": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "note": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "target": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "region": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "mounted": {
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "style_suffix": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "backend3d",
      "id",
      "ingest",
      "kind",
      "prompt",
      "seeds",
      "target"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false
  }
}
